Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls and I see the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything Will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me Push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\NWhat I hope you're away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in your head! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This just keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem you're still\Nalive if only barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only delaying the\Ninevitable, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stand up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the cost, if I can delay you\Nfor even a moment, then I'll be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Bay Marco, we got the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,key guy I thought I was dead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but you saved me save it\Nfor later unlock these cuffs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vice Admiral, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay out of this, you old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you better keep holding me\Nlike that, because if you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that I am going\Nto murder Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to execute a traitor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems my job is never done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jipe, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki users, what a pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're far too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle has ended.\NFirefist is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you some help, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for trying so hard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But looks like this is as far as I can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody please, please help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can still save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, don't just\Nstand there, he's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Doctor, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not looking good! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see the wound, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a doctor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even gonna try?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come all this way to lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can't just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He burned through my organs too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel my life slipping away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,God, the fight's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we can still save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're gonna give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the big brother I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember your promise, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Sabo, a certain\Nlittle brother I had to look after.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't want you turning\Nout like me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have never been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I never deserved to\Nlive in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Gold Roger had a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd end up just like his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Off with his damn head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, after all the crap he\Nstarted, Roger got off too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we'd count up all the man's crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and prick his boy with\Na needle for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I bet all the pirates\Nwould worship that kid like a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have to do something really nasty,.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,like burn him alive and\Nmake everybody watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pirates, why\Ndon't you go join him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't probably cry\Nand shut him down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trashed just like my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I should die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I almost wish he didn't have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I never asked to be born,\Nbut they hated me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you ace didn't I just tell
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you to stop this I don't\Ncare what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just making life\Nharder for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey are you listening\Nto me don't hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna stop me from doing\Nwhat I would have killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,all if I could and one of these\Ndays I'll be strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:12:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah if you see dadan tell her I said
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,hello and thank her for\Nputting up with us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd miss a woman like her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess dying does\Nfunny things to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one thing that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be around to see\Nyou fulfill your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to live life,\Nand that's without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, we're going to head out to\Nsea and live the way we want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,More free than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I lived with no regrets, even\Nthough it ended this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't complain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, things could have gone\Nbetter, but it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized I didn't need\Nfame or fortune after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All I needed was the answer\Nto a single question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very end, did I deserve to be born?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will call you my son, who\Nwe've got plenty to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you not killing my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, you're my brother, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Say whatever mean stuff you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Ace to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you're done with\Nthat, destroy the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't raise my voice anymore, too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you tell everyone else what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to say when I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, my family, and you, Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for caring
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,about someone like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,who's good
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This world never wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One has such bad blood in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,loving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I deserve to be born\NOr was it just a mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep living\NAnd hope you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't really think\NI was dead, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.74,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop your crying and\Nhave some faith for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not gonna die, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not as long as I've got a wussy\Nlittle brother who needs me to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look after my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our son's name is Goldie Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes to become\Nbrothers is to share some sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, from here on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we're honest-to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-goodness brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
